WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:03.950
I need... to talk to you.

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:06.760
I'm still asleep...

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.790
Go ahead and talk. Don't expect a response though.

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:12.120
OK. Good enough.

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:17.530
In Junior High, we both used to play basketball.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:22.460
After practice we'd stay over at the court and practice shooting.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:27.200
We were just playing at first... but we became very competitive.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.140
We'd play until we were exhausted.

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.620
That story again...?

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.570
That's nothing new. I'm hanging up.

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.040
You're still part of the team.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:39.680
So what...? I'm not interested anymore.

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:44.880
Your number is still here, waiting for you to come back.

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:46.840
I'm hanging up. For sure now.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:48.140
Wait!

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.340
Goodnight.

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:55.040
<b>16. Comeback</b>

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:14.290
So, now no one's left here.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:18.830
With only a single light illuminating the one hoop,

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:21.510
...and without applause, you continue to take shot after shot.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:24.760
Is all this sweat proof of the flower of your youth?

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:29.020
Or is it to help you forget the pain?

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.890
There's no pain in my life!

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:37.940
This makes me feel great. You deciding to come back.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.190
No way! I'm just here to tease you.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:46.000
But you know, you don't really need this extra training.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.510
Seiran's star player Orihara...

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.730
...has been famous as a national-class player since Junior High.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:52.910
I need to make up for my recent absence.

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:59.310
I'm no natural. Not like you are.

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:03.570
A "woman of effort and diligence", you used to say...

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:05.570
Shut up!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:09.810
This "woman of effort and diligence" has at least one crazy fan.

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:10.950
What?

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:15.430
She's been watching you intently...

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:17.710
...since long before I arrived on the scene.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:19.860
Who's there?

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.390
What's going on? Why are you running away?

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:34.470
I'm NOT running away!

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:37.640
Come here. I can get you an autograph.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:41.800
I'm not a groupie!

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.080
Now, now!

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.990
I'm no groupie, you understand?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.430
You're not.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:51.310
See! See! Kaoru-no-Kimi confirmed it.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:55.410
Then may I ask, considering that it is very late and after school,

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:58.290
...just what it is you are doing here?

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:00.440
Checking on the state of her health.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:01.970
"State of her health"?

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:04.570
Yes, really! Tsurugaoka School is a tough opponent!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.650
Even though it's just an exhibition match tomorrow,

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.530
...we need Kaoru-no-Kimi!

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:13.460
Is she truly recovered? Or is she just making an enormous effort?

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.400
It's natural to worry about it!

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:18.970
You can't expect me to just go home and watch TV!

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:22.440
Hey now, isn't this exactly like a groupie?

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:25.540
No that's not it!

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.330
Excuse me... Kaoru-no-Kimi? <b> </b>

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:28.130
Excuse me... Kaoru-no-Kimi? Yes?

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:29.600
Please take this.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.970
Excuse me!

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:37.910
What is it?

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.160
Sports drink.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:49.990
My Dear Brother,

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:55.890
Finally I have a moment to write you a pleasant letter.

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:58.500
Actually, I think I really want to write a lot.

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:03.280
Tomorrow is Kaoru-no-Kimi's first game,

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:05.160
...after a long absence.

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:12.000
Oh no! You can't make it after school today, Tomoko?

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:13.810
No, there's my Cooking Club.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:15.320
We're baking apple pie.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.930
Don't go! Which is more important?

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:19.470
Kaoru-no-Kimi or apple pie?

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:23.090
But I don't understand the first thing about basketball...

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:26.170
You'll understand and enjoy it. It has such power!

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:29.050
Especially Kaoru-no-Kimi's 3-Point shot!

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:31.470
It's so magnificent!

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:33.210
Do you know anything about this, Nanako?

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:34.880
This 3-point shot?

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:35.950
Sure.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:41.580
Well listen up! There's a 3-point line marked on the court,

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.590
...so we're talking about shots taken outside that line.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:44.930
I get it now.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.940
It's so difficult!

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:49.420
And rarely successful since it's so far from the goal.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:51.700
That's why it gets 3 points.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:55.260
She doesn't get it.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:58.200
Besides, it's her comeback game!

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.550
...even though it's only an exhibition match.

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:04.610
Tomoko - don't you have any sense of obligation?

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.760
You're really hot on...

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:07.630
On what...?

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:10.440
Kaoru-no-Kimi! On Kaoru-no-Kimi...!

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:13.570
It's suspicious.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:17.190
No way! She's such a tomboy!

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:18.890
Don't say such nonsense!

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:20.510
You're blushing!

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:23.130
I don't think I like Tomoko-san after all!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.870
How come she's so mean?

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.480
She's been like that since childhood.

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.420
I hate you!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.090
Good morning...

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:28.620
Good morning. Good morning...

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:28.960
Good morning. <b> </b>

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:29.630
Good morning. See you after school!

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:30.360
See you after school!

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.370
Tomoko, see you after school.

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:34.250
We'll see! Bye!

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:39.960
Kaoru-sama, best wishes for today's game!

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:41.970
I'll come to see you!

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.590
This is for you.

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:47.350
It'll be "Kaoru-no-Kimi Day", all day today!

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:52.650
Oh no, no! Shame! Kaoru-no-Kimi doesn't like groupies.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:56.310
Kaoru-no-Kimi!

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:00.910
Please let me have your autograph!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.060
To commemorate today's victory!

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:06.330
What? The game hasn't even started yet.

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.170
I know you'll win!

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:13.770
How are you?

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:15.850
Uh... Oh!

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:18.990
You look like you're in a hurry.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:20.730
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:23.090
Good... good morning!

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.900
Mmmm... You look fine.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:28.640
Yes, thanks! And you, Saint-Juste-sama?

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.840
Just the same as usual...

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:35.150
My Dear Brother...

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:41.890
I have a premonition that today will be truly, truly wonderful...!

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:57.570
Coach....

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.860
What's wrong, Orihara... everyone's already on the court.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:02.870
Give me a few more minutes.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:06.080
I'm very nervous, believe it or not.

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:11.380
You? Nervous? Ha, ha... I guess so!

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:14.120
I want to win so badly... today.

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:19.010
Hey, now. Don't try to make up for when you weren't playing.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:22.630
I'll be easy on you today. Don't overdo it.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:23.440
Right.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:24.980
See ya. I'll be out front.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:26.320
Sure!

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:28.520
Thanks, Coach.

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:30.600
But I want to be a winner.

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:35.590
I want to win everything from now on.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:40.070
Then, I won't have to remember...

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:44.530
I can forget, because I love.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.820
I can forget, because I've loved.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:53.890
And I'll even forget that I've forgotten.

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:58.670
I loved you that much...

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:09.540
If I can be a winner from now on...

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:12.110
...then I can stay positive about the future.

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:37.600
Here. For you, Orihara-san.

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:41.270
We offer this special commendation to you, Orihara-san,

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:45.760
...to mark your return as Seiran team captain after a long absence.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:48.100
We wish you the very best.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:50.430
I'm not a member...

00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:56.460
The Sorority may choose to honor any Seiran student with a commendation.

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:59.010
You don't understand.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.570
I must accept that a sorority does exist on campus,

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:05.920
...but I don't accept that it is a valid part of Seiran in the least.

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:08.480
Excuse me.

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:10.700
Orihara-san...

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:17.200
If... if and when you permit Asaka Rei to rejoin our team,

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.680
...perhaps then I may accept flower from you.

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:24.730
Bye.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:34.670
The exhibition match between Seiran and Tsurugaoka will now begin.

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:35.990
Let's go!

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:38.830
Fight!

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:21.240
Kaoru-no-Kimi! Go for it!

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:34.190
Listen! We've got to stop Orihara-san!

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:37.070
If we can block her, Seiran is nothing.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:39.020
Play this game on OUR terms!

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:40.470
Fight! <b> </b>

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:41.610
Fight! Fight!

00:12:57.570 --> 00:12:58.510
Darn!

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:16.700
What's the matter with Kaoru-no-Kimi?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.920
She doesn't look like herself.

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:22.730
Their whole team is blocking her! She has no room to play!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.670
She must be tired.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:29.140
Right after her recovery... Maybe it's too soon.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.180
I've hardly begun.

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:40.370
I'll STILL win this!

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:52.380
It's not working. She's recovered!

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.610
More, then! Put three on her!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:28.320
Orihara, don't overexert yourself!

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:29.930
This isn't an official match.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:31.680
I'm worried you might hurt yourself.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:33.890
Hurt myself? Me?

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:37.340
We're about to catch up to them!

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:39.590
Besides...

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:40.780
"Besides"?

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:44.360
It's been so long...

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:46.240
...since I could play this hard!

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:50.250
What?

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:52.660
Let's go!

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:27.180
Blood!

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:42.060
Orihara...!

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:44.020
Kaoru-no-Kimi!

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:45.250
Mariko-san!

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:49.230
Bring her to the nurse! Get a stretcher! A stretcher!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.060
I can't believe it.

00:15:51.390 --> 00:15:55.680
I know I fouled her, but I didn't hit her that hard.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.490
Leave me alone!

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:00.670
I'm fine. Get away!

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:03.350
Rei! REI!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:06.700
Get away! DON'T TOUCH ME!

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:07.840
<b>Rei!</b>

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.570
I'm right here. Right here.

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:13.410
Calm down.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.080
You're not yourself.

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:21.100
I'll take her to the nurse.

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:23.060
Umm... yes, do...

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:29.300
Please...

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:30.510
Open the door.

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:37.900
Wait a minute.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:39.380
Why?

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.140
I'm fine.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.120
Huh?

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:45.360
I'm OK now. I was just in shock.

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:48.010
But there's something I want from you.

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:51.820
I want you to play for me... in this game.

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:54.630
Coach!

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:57.420
Please announce a player change.

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:04.790
We will have a replacement player for Seiran.

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:11.040
Seiran's Orihara Kaoru-san will be replaced by Asaka Rei-san.

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:17.290
She's back! The great Number 16!

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:19.590
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.200
My Dear Brother...

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:37.470
Because of Kaoru-no-Kimi's injury,

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:39.950
...the outcome of the game became impossible to predict.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.410
But it was so exciting when Saint-Juste entered the game.

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:48.140
Trying desperately to lead the inferior Seiran team to victory,

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:51.020
...Saint-Juste-sama furiously traversed the court.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:54.380
Her carriage, her expression, and her eyes...

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:57.190
...they were those of a wild animal!

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:59.590
Her eyes gleamed like a young boy's.

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:07.160
I'd never seen Saint-Juste-sama like this!

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:20.490
She was alive! She was really alive!

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:27.370
Brother, something must have awakened within her,

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:31.790
...something that had been asleep, something vital...

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:44.240
Amazing! Saint-Juste-sama made another shot...!

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:47.970
Mariko-san?

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.940
Rei played in the game?

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:26.000
Yes. She replaced Orihara, who was injured.

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:27.450
I see.

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:30.550
The game just ended...

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:33.100
And the result?

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:34.950
Yes, the game was...

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.600
Mariko-san! Wait!

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:00.370
I don't understand! She's not in the nurse's office!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.850
This doesn't make sense!

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:05.530
Where did she disappear to? Where is she?

00:20:06.160 --> 00:20:07.300
Maybe she...

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:09.580
Where? WHERE??

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:30.890
Did we win?

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:35.460
We got within 2 points... 8 seconds remaining...

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:41.690
I stole a pass from them in our territory, shoved my way clear,

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:44.780
...and then made for the goal.

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:49.040
It was tough... everyone was defending against me...

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:52.790
I couldn't get close to the goal,

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:56.000
...and we were two behind, with only a 3-point shot left...

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:59.200
You went for it? You took a 3-point shot!?

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:04.320
It was a bit far, but I did... There was no other choice.

00:21:05.850 --> 00:21:06.720
And...?

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:09.270
It was close.

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:12.400
The ball circled the rim and fell out, onto the floor.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:19.200
I tried... my best.

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:21.370
Thank you.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:23.050
That's fine.

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:26.130
There are always times like that.

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:28.940
Yes. I've had times like that.

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:41.160
Hurry up Nanako-san!

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:42.790
Mariko-san!

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:44.390
You're so slow!

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:46.700
Mariko-san! Wait for me!

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:48.250
No running!

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:50.410
How's your injury?

00:21:51.960 --> 00:21:55.450
One of them re-opened. It's nothing serious.

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:59.380
But the doctor is telling me to stop exerting myself.

00:22:05.840 --> 00:22:06.710
Who is it?

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:10.200
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:12.710
Were you listening?

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:13.550
What?

00:22:13.610 --> 00:22:16.290
Were you listening to our conversation?

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:19.110
No... we just got here.

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:22.050
What about Kaoru-no-Kimi's injury?

00:22:22.890 --> 00:22:25.640
Don't worry. Nothing serious.

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:27.490
Don't lie to me! <b> </b>

00:22:27.490 --> 00:22:28.230
Don't lie to me! What?

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:32.440
It was too bloody to be "nothing serious"!

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:35.500
Get away. Let me see Kaoru-no-Kimi!

00:22:35.920 --> 00:22:37.060
Mariko-san...!

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:53.430
I heard you threatening Rei in the hallway. What a scene!

00:22:56.630 --> 00:22:58.370
I'm glad you're here.

00:22:58.380 --> 00:23:00.320
Thanks for coming. I appreciate it.

00:23:01.260 --> 00:23:05.020
It... It was Nanako who insisted on coming.

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:11.670
Are... are you really glad I came?

00:23:12.150 --> 00:23:13.020
Hmmm?

00:23:13.220 --> 00:23:17.570
You said you're glad I came. Really?

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:20.070
Yes. Of course.

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:21.920
Thank goodness.

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:25.330
My Dear Brother...

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:29.300
This was the moment when I first realized it.

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:34.660
She had deep feelings of love for Kaoru-no-Kimi.

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:39.680
So perhaps the most magnificent person that day...

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:42.620
...wasn't Saint-Juste-sama or Kaoru-no-Kimi.

00:23:43.170 --> 00:23:46.320
Perhaps it was Mariko-san instead.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:01.540 --> 00:25:03.820
Preview

00:25:04.020 --> 00:25:06.360
Nanako finds that she is envious

00:25:06.360 --> 00:25:10.450
...of Mariko's directness in expressing her inner feelings.

00:25:11.020 --> 00:25:15.040
Nanako then accidentally misplaces a letter to Henmi...

00:25:15.170 --> 00:25:18.850
...and the letter ends up in Fukiko's hands.

00:25:19.340 --> 00:25:20.150
Next episode: <b> </b>

00:25:20.150 --> 00:25:21.290
Next episode: <b>P.S. ---</b>

00:25:21.810 --> 00:25:23.420
Brother, Dear Brother... <b> </b>

00:25:23.420 --> 00:25:27.500
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
